   "where": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Pitch is a techno template inspired by the legendary Dino Maggiorana. Use it to learn professional techniques and tricks built entirely with native Ableton plugins.",
   "pages": [
    "/all-products/"
   ],
   "where": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Mutualism is a fresh take on dark techno, inspired by Adam Beyer and Vitaly Mc'lay. Driving drums, a deep bass line and sharp percussive shots create a dark, hypnotic atmosphere.",
   "pages": [
    "/all-products/"
   ],
   "where": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Intricate is a full-length dark techno template for Ableton Live 11, produced by Grenør. It uses native Ableton plugins only, including FM synthesis for the kick and hi-hats.",
   "pages": [
    "/all-products/"
   ],
   "where": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Infinity is a full-length Ableton Live 11 template produced by Grenør. This driving 130 BPM track in A minor is built with native Ableton plugins only, so no external plugins are needed.",
   "pages": [
    "/all-products/"
   ],
   "where": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Kratos is a full-length dark techno template for Ableton Live 10, produced by Grenør. Built with native Ableton plugins only, it is easy to customize: learn how the sound is made, then reshape it into your own track.",
   "pages": [
    "/all-products/"
   ],
   "where": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Protos is a full-length techno template for Ableton Live 10, produced by Grenør. Built with native Ableton plugins only, it is packed with samples and polyrhythmic, syncopated grooves made for the dance floor.",
   "pages": [
    "/all-products/"
   ],
